[*] AXI-over-UCIe -> AXI memory : GENERIC layout (fallback).
[*]
[*] Applied by `make wave` for any cocotb TEST that has no bespoke layout of its
[*] own in dv/waves/.  Group scheme (shared by every layout in this directory):
[*]   Clock/Reset -> AXI front door -> AoU bridge -> UCIe link -> Sec 6 credits
[*]   -> memory.  GTKWave never auto-populates its wave pane; without this file
[*]   the FST opens blank.
[*]
[*] wave-check: env=cocotb
[dumpfile] "dv/cocotb/sim_build/axi_ucie_mem_top.fst"
